-image-container card-rarity-3\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Medium_Energy_Core\" title=\"Medium Energy Core\"><img alt=\"Medium Energy Core\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"74\" height=\"74\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Item Medium Energy Core.png\" data-image-key=\"Item_Medium_Energy_Core.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/1/18/Item_Medium_Energy_Core.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/74?cb=20240524153056\" /></a></span></span><span class=\"card-text card-font\"> 2</span></span></div><div class=\"card-container\"><span class=\"card-body\"><span class=\"card-image-container card-rarity-3\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Medium_Sealed_Tube\" title=\"Medium Sealed Tube\"><img alt=\"Medium Sealed Tube\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"74\" height=\"74\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Item Medium Sealed Tube.png\" data-image-key=\"Item_Medium_Sealed_Tube.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/7e/Item_Medium_Sealed_Tube.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/74?cb=20240529094325\" /></a></span></span><span class=\"card-text card-font\"> 1</span></span></div><div class=\"card-container\"><span class=\"card-body\"><span class=\"card-image-container card-rarity-3\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shell_Credit\" title=\"Shell Credit\"><img alt=\"Shell Credit\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"74\" height=\"74\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Item Shell Credit.png\" data-image-key=\"Item_Shell_Credit.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/d/d1/Item_Shell_Credit.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/74?cb=20240523132525\" /></a></span></span><span class=\"card-text card-font\"> 3,000</span></span></div></span></div>\n</div>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n<b>Fairy Tale's Finale: Epilogue</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Side_Quest\" title=\"Side Quest\">Side Quest</a> that occurs in <a href=\"/wiki/Whining_Aix%27s_Mire\" title=\"Whining Aix&#39;s Mire\">Whining Aix's Mire</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Huanglong\" title=\"Huanglong\">Huanglong</a>, [[{{{nation}}}]].\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Steps\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Steps</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Gameplay_Notes\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Gameplay Notes</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Dialogue\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Dialogue</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Gallery\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Gallery</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Other_Languages\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Other Languages</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Change_History\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Change History</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Steps\">Steps</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ol><li>Have another chat with <span class=\"new\" title=\"Dorothy (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvRG9yb3RoeT9hY3Rpb249ZWRpdCZyZWRsaW5rPTE=\">Dorothy</span></li></ol>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gameplay_Notes\">Gameplay Notes</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>This quest is limited.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Dialogue\">Dialogue</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<dd><div class=\"description-wrapper\"><div class=\"description-title\"><b><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"UI Quest\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/0/0f/UI_Quest.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20260501180345\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"UI Quest.png\" data-image-key=\"UI_Quest.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></span></span> Quest Description</b></div><hr class=\"description-separator\" /><div class=\"description-content\">Fairy Tale's Finale: Epilogue</div></div></dd>\n<div class=\"dialogue\">\n<dl><dt>(Say hello)</dt>\n<dd><b>\"Dorothy\":</b> Thank you! Now my friends can all go home!</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></span></span> Your friends?</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" /></span></span> I thought you said YOU wanted to go home?</dd>\n<dd><b>\"Dorothy\":</b> Yeah, the current \"me\" you're talking to belongs to the other side of the Gate.</dd>\n<dd><b>\"Dorothy\":</b> ...But when it comes to us in another point in time... Our home is right here, on this side.</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" /></span></span> You live in the Somnoire?</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" /></span></span> Who are you?</dd>\n<dd><b>Dorothy falls silent, looking down at her toes.</b></dd>\n<dd><b>\"Dorothy?\":</b> Aww... I should've saw this coming. A child's dream persona is still too naive. Can't expect her to learn how to hide her true self...</dd>\n<dd><b>\"Dorothy?\":</b> Not like I ever wanted to hide it from you forever, though...</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" /></span></span> So you lied to me.\n<dl><dd><b>\"Dorothy?\":</b> Lying? Not quite. At least I can promise you... Everything I've told you this time is true.</dd>\n<dd><b>\"Dorothy?\":</b> Dorothy is a good girl. She won't ever intentionally lie to anyone, not even in a dream.</dd></dl></dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" /></span></span> You're that \"<a href=\"/wiki/Cosmos\" title=\"Cosmos\">Cosmos</a>\" from before, aren't you?\n<dl><dd><b>\"Dorothy?\":</b> Not bad, (&#8205;<span class=\"custom-tt-wrapper toggle-tooltip mw-collapsible mw-made-collapsible mw-collapsed wuwa-collapsible\" data-tt-text=\"Rover\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle mw-collapsible-toggle-collapsed custom-tt toggle-tooltip\">Rover</span><span class=\"mw-collapsible-content custom-tt\" style=\"display:none\">The player's chosen name for Rover</span></span>&#8205;), you've figured it out already... Yes. You can say that was me.</dd>\n<dd><b>\"Dorothy?\":</b> I found the dream of a troublemaker and copied it into a Wooly plushie in the dream world.</dd></dl></dd>\n<dd><b>\"Dorothy?\":</b> And then... I was able to manifest in Solaris-3 and talk to you.</dd>\n<dd><b>\"Dorothy?\":</b> Figured it'd be simpler for us to talk like this, with our real positions and identities making things tricky.</dd>\n<dd><b>\"Dorothy?\":</b> Come on, don't give me that suspicious side eye... I offered to pay you accordingly. It's been a fair deal, right?</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" /></span></span> What are you trying to do?</dd>\n<dd><b>\"Dorothy?\":</b> ...Sorry, I can't say. Not yet.</dd>\n<dd><b>\"Dorothy?\":</b> But it may not take long before the right time comes.</dd>\n<dd><b>\"Dorothy?\":</b> And when it happens... I hope you'll understand my choice, (&#8205;<span class=\"custom-tt-wrapper toggle-tooltip mw-collapsible mw-made-collapsible mw-collapsed wuwa-collapsible\" data-tt-text=\"Rover\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle mw-collapsible-toggle-collapsed custom-tt toggle-tooltip\">Rover</span><span class=\"mw-collapsible-content custom-tt\" style=\"display:none\">The player's chosen name for Rover</span></span>&#8205;).</dd>\n<dt>(Quest Complete)</dt></dl>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<figure class=\"thumb mw-halign-none show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 180px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/b/b1/Dorothy_in_Fairy_Tale%27s_Finale.png/revision/latest?cb=20241006212030\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Dorothy in Fairy Tale&#39;s Finale\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"101\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Dorothy in Fairy Tale&#39;s Finale.png\" data-image-key=\"Dorothy_in_Fairy_Tale%27s_Finale.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/b/b1/Dorothy_in_Fairy_Tale%27s_Finale.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20241006212030\" /></a> \t<noscript><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/b/b1/Dorothy_in_Fairy_Tale%27s_Finale.png/revision/latest?cb=20241006212030\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Dorothy in Fairy Tale&#039;s Finale\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/b/b1/Dorothy_in_Fairy_Tale%27s_Finale.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20241006212030\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"101\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Dorothy in Fairy Tale&#039;s Finale.png\" data-image-key=\"Dorothy_in_Fairy_Tale%27s_Finale.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/b/b1/Dorothy_in_Fairy_Tale%27s_Finale.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20241006212030\" /></a></noscript> \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> 